{
  "title": "Managoat / Latency",
  "uid": "managoat-latency",
  "tags": [
    "managoat",
    "latency",
    "sandboxes"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "prometheus"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "DS_TEMPO",
        "label": "Tempo",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "tempo",
        "current": {
          "text": "Tempo",
          "value": "tempo"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "namespace",
        "label": "Namespace",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(fountain_turn_completed_duration_ms_count, namespace)",
          "refId": "namespace"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "fountain",
          "value": "fountain"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "provider",
        "label": "Provider",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(fountain_turn_completed_duration_ms_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}, provider)",
          "refId": "provider"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "runtime",
        "label": "Runtime",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(fountain_turn_completed_duration_ms_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\",provider=~\"$provider\"}, runtime)",
          "refId": "runtime"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "window",
        "label": "Rolling window",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "5m,15m,30m,1h,6h",
        "current": {
          "text": "30m",
          "value": "30m"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "5m",
            "value": "5m",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "15m",
            "value": "15m",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "30m",
            "value": "30m",
            "selected": true
          },
          {
            "text": "1h",
            "value": "1h",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "6h",
            "value": "6h",
            "selected": false
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What this measures",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Live application telemetry, not the echo-test harness. **Provider/runtime filters apply to turn panels only.** Provisioning, steps, reattachment and stage failures currently have no provider/runtime labels.\n\n**First visible update** starts at application turn start and ends at agent text, thinking, a tool call or a plan; it is not first response text or HTTP submission latency. Fresh and follow-up turns are pooled; models and reasoning settings are pooled too. Reattachment excludes some wake/admission work. There is no launch-to-first-text metric: do not add percentiles or interpret these panels as a cold-start total.\n\nPercentiles are histogram estimates. Check the sample-count panel, particularly at low traffic; no samples means no data, not zero latency. Failed turns are excluded from successful duration panels and shown separately. Trace searches below use the selected time range and show all providers; open a trace to inspect its model and turn number.\n\nTempo currently has turn and individual provisioning-step spans; whole provisioning/reattachment spans were not found during live validation. The global duration metrics above remain available."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "First visible update \u00b7 p50 / p95",
      "description": "Turn start to first agent text/thinking/tool/plan; not ACP handshake, not necessarily response text. Grouped by provider/runtime; pooled models and turn numbers.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (provider,runtime,le) (rate(fountain_turn_first_update_elapsed_ms_bucket{namespace=~\"$namespace\",provider=~\"$provider\",runtime=~\"$runtime\"}[$window]))) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} / {{runtime}} p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (provider,runtime,le) (rate(fountain_turn_first_update_elapsed_ms_bucket{namespace=~\"$namespace\",provider=~\"$provider\",runtime=~\"$runtime\"}[$window]))) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} / {{runtime}} p95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Successful turn completion \u00b7 p50 / p95",
      "description": "Application turn duration for completed turns only. Includes runtime/session startup where needed. Pooled task complexity; compare similar workloads.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (provider,runtime,le) (rate(fountain_turn_completed_duration_ms_bucket{namespace=~\"$namespace\",provider=~\"$provider\",runtime=~\"$runtime\",status=\"completed\"}[$window]))) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} / {{runtime}} p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (provider,runtime,le) (rate(fountain_turn_completed_duration_ms_bucket{namespace=~\"$namespace\",provider=~\"$provider\",runtime=~\"$runtime\",status=\"completed\"}[$window]))) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} / {{runtime}} p95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "First visible update \u00b7 mean",
      "description": "Histogram sum/count gives the measured mean; unlike quantiles it does not interpolate buckets.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (provider,runtime) (rate(fountain_turn_first_update_elapsed_ms_sum{namespace=~\"$namespace\",provider=~\"$provider\",runtime=~\"$runtime\"}[$window])) / sum by (provider,runtime) (rate(fountain_turn_first_update_elapsed_ms_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\",provider=~\"$provider\",runtime=~\"$runtime\"}[$window])) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} / {{runtime}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Visible-update samples per window",
      "description": "Estimated observations in the rolling window. A turn with no visible update contributes no latency sample; use failures alongside this panel.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (provider,runtime) (increase(fountain_turn_first_update_elapsed_ms_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\",provider=~\"$provider\",runtime=~\"$runtime\"}[$window]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} / {{runtime}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Terminal turn outcomes per window",
      "description": "Completed, failed and interrupted turns with duration observations. Shows failures instead of letting them masquerade as fast successful responses.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (provider,runtime,status) (increase(fountain_turn_completed_duration_ms_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\",provider=~\"$provider\",runtime=~\"$runtime\"}[$window]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} / {{runtime}} / {{status}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Failed share of terminal turns",
      "description": "Failed divided by all terminal turns per runtime/provider; interrupted turns remain in the denominator. Missing failure series becomes zero only where terminal samples exist.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(sum by (provider,runtime) (rate(fountain_turn_completed_duration_ms_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\",provider=~\"$provider\",runtime=~\"$runtime\",status=\"failed\"}[$window])) or 0 * sum by (provider,runtime) (rate(fountain_turn_completed_duration_ms_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\",provider=~\"$provider\",runtime=~\"$runtime\"}[$window]))) / sum by (provider,runtime) (rate(fountain_turn_completed_duration_ms_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\",provider=~\"$provider\",runtime=~\"$runtime\"}[$window]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} / {{runtime}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Fresh provisioning \u00b7 all providers/runtimes",
      "description": "Application fresh_provision span, not HTTP request-to-ready. No provider/runtime/outcome labels today; includes attempts returning normally even when their result is a failure. Mean and estimated percentiles.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum (rate(fountain_fresh_provision_stop_duration_sum{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$window])) / sum (rate(fountain_fresh_provision_stop_duration_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$window])) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "mean"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(fountain_fresh_provision_stop_duration_bucket{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$window]))) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(fountain_fresh_provision_stop_duration_bucket{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$window]))) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Reattachment \u00b7 all providers/runtimes",
      "description": "Application reattach span; not total wake endpoint latency and not proof of a cold provider wake. No provider/runtime/outcome labels today.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 30
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum (rate(fountain_reattach_stop_duration_sum{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$window])) / sum (rate(fountain_reattach_stop_duration_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$window])) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "mean"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(fountain_reattach_stop_duration_bucket{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$window]))) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(fountain_reattach_stop_duration_bucket{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$window]))) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Bootstrap / reattachment steps \u00b7 mean",
      "description": "Named provision_step spans, including reattach_* steps. All providers/runtimes combined. Parallel or nested steps overlap: do not sum them to calculate elapsed time.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 38
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (step) (rate(fountain_provision_step_stop_duration_sum{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$window])) / sum by (step) (rate(fountain_provision_step_stop_duration_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$window])) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "{{step}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Bootstrap / reattachment steps \u00b7 p95",
      "description": "Estimated p95 per named step, pooled providers/runtimes. Steps may overlap and cannot be added. Includes adapter install and configuration work.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 38
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (step,le) (rate(fountain_provision_step_stop_duration_bucket{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$window]))) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "{{step}} p95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Provisioning / reattachment samples per window",
      "description": "Rolling observation counts for the global spans; use to judge whether latency percentiles have enough traffic.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 46
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(fountain_fresh_provision_stop_duration_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$window]))",
          "legendFormat": "fresh provision"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(increase(fountain_reattach_stop_duration_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$window]))",
          "legendFormat": "reattach"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Failed stages per window \u00b7 all providers/runtimes",
      "description": "Durable stage failures, including provisioning and model-selection failures. No provider/runtime labels; stages are not distinct conversations, so do not sum as a user failure count.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 46
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (stage) (increase(fountain_stage_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\",status=\"failed\"}[$window]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{stage}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Turn traces \u00b7 model and turn number",
      "description": "Recent matching traces, not sorted by latency. Turn spans contain runtime/model/turn number; use these to inspect first versus later turns. All providers and namespaces.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 54
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "${DS_TEMPO}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"fountain\" && name=\"fountain.turn\"} | select(span.runtime, span.model, span.turn_number)",
          "limit": 30,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Provisioning step traces",
      "description": "Individual provision_step spans, including reattach_* steps. Open a trace to inspect its step and conversation ID. Whole fresh_provision/reattach spans were not found in the verified production six-hour window; use the metrics above for those totals. All providers and namespaces.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 54
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "${DS_TEMPO}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"fountain\" && name=\"fountain.provision_step\"} | select(span.conv_id, span.step)",
          "limit": 30,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
